                        Anne Lawrence Mathers, <title>Manuscripts in Northumbria in the 11th and 12th Centuries</title> (Woodbridge, 2003), 184–5,
                        writes that <q>the overall style and presentation of the book</q> fits Bridlington, but notes the uncertainty.</p></provenance>
